### Company API Examples
### Sử dụng với REST Client extension trong VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = your-admin-jwt-token-here

### ============================================
### PUBLIC ENDPOINTS (Không cần authentication)
### ============================================

### 1. Get all companies (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?page=1&pageSize=20
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get all companies (with search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?search=FPT
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get company detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/company-uuid-here
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS (Yêu cầu ADMIN role)
### ============================================

### 4. Get companies stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Get all companies (admin view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Get all companies (admin view with search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies?page=1&limit=10&search=FPT
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Get company types
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/types
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Create new company (without logo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "FPT Software",
  "size": "1000+",
  "nation": "Việt Nam",
  "description": "Công ty phần mềm hàng đầu Việt Nam",
  "address": "Tòa nhà FPT, Duy Tân, Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội",
  "websiteUrl": "https://fptsoftware.com",
  "typeId": "type-uuid-here"
}

### 9. Create new company (with logo - multipart/form-data)
### Note: Sử dụng Postman hoặc curl cho request này
### curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/admin/companies \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer your-token" \
###   -F "name=FPT Software" \
###   -F "size=1000+" \
###   -F "nation=Việt Nam" \
###   -F "description=Công ty phần mềm hàng đầu" \
###   -F "address=Hà Nội" \
###   -F "websiteUrl=https://fptsoftware.com" \
###   -F "typeId=type-uuid" \
###   -F "logo=@/path/to/logo.png"

### 10. Get company by ID (admin view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/company-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Update company (without logo)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/company-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "FPT Software Vietnam",
  "size": "2000+",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### 12. Update company (with logo - multipart/form-data)
### Note: Sử dụng Postman hoặc curl cho request này
### curl -X PUT http://localhost:3000/admin/companies/company-uuid \
###   -H "Authorization: Bearer your-token" \
###   -F "name=FPT Software Vietnam" \
###   -F "logo=@/path/to/new-logo.png"

### 13. Delete company
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/company-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================
### ERROR CASES
### ============================================

### 14. Create company with duplicate name (should return 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "FPT Software"
}

### 15. Create company without required fields (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": "100-500"
}

### 16. Update non-existent company (should return 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/non-existent-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Company"
}

### 17. Delete company with active jobs (should return 409)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/company-with-jobs-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. Access admin endpoint without token (should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/stats

### 19. Access admin endpoint with non-admin token (should return 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/stats
Authorization: Bearer non-admin-token-here

### ============================================
### TESTING WORKFLOW
### ============================================

### Step 1: Login as admin to get token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Step 2: Get company types
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/types
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 3: Create a new company
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Company",
  "size": "50-100",
  "nation": "Việt Nam",
  "description": "This is a test company",
  "address": "Hà Nội",
  "websiteUrl": "https://testcompany.com",
  "typeId": "type-uuid-from-step-2"
}

### Step 4: Get the created company
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/company-uuid-from-step-3
Content-Type: application/json

### Step 5: Update the company
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/company-uuid-from-step-3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description for test company"
}

### Step 6: Delete the company
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/companies/company-uuid-from-step-3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 7: Verify company is deleted (should return 404 or null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/company-uuid-from-step-3
Content-Type: application/json
